            "description": "<p>The Order of the Rack uses weapons like the <em>dreamcrusher</em> to crush those who dare stand in the way. This <em>+1 longsword</em> has additional weight at the tip of its blade for the wielder to drive home their strikes.</p><p><strong>Activate—Doom the Rebel:</strong> @Glyph[Action 1] (@Trait[Concentrate]{концентрация}, @Trait[Mental]{ментальный})</p><p><strong>Частота:</strong> Раз в 10 минут</p><p><strong>Требования:</strong> Your last action was a Strike with the dreamcrusher that critically hit a creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Эффект:</strong> The creature you critically hit must attempt a @Check[will|dc:19|traits:mental] save. On a failure, they take a –1 status penalty to attack rolls and skill checks for 1 round (1 minute on a critical failure).</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.2gKeytEnwpXhaLXM]</p>"
