            "type": "equipment",
            "nameRus": "Devilwing Badge (Major)",
            "description": "<p>This small tearing of a devil's wing has been cleansed with holy water before being mounted onto a silver badge. The spell attack modifier of any spell cast by Activating this item is +19, and the spell DC is 29.</p><ul><li><strong>Доспех:</strong> You gain resistance 10 to fire and unholy.</li><li><strong>Оружие:</strong> After you cast a spell by Activating the <em>devilwing badge</em>, your Strikes with the weapon deal an additional 1d8 spirit damage until the end of your next turn.</li></ul><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.IdlSIN88G5Ca7TLe]</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.JuyEDBlFwyDguEzG]</p><hr /><p><strong>Активация:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.aBQ8ajvEBByv45yz]</p><p><strong>Эффект:</strong> Вы сотворяете @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.qwZBXN6zBoB9BHXE].</p><hr /><p><strong>Активация:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.aBQ8ajvEBByv45yz]</p><p><strong>Частота:</strong> Раз в день</p><p><strong>Эффект:</strong> You cast 4th-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.3x6eUCm17n6ROzUa].</p><hr /><p><strong>Активация:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.aBQ8ajvEBByv45yz]</p><p><strong>Частота:</strong> Раз в день</p><p><strong>Эффект:</strong> Вы сотворяете @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.hVU9msO9yGkxKZ3J].</p>"
