            "type": "shield",
            "nameRus": "Imposing Shield",
            "description": "<p>A favorite of Hellknights, this steel shield is often emblazoned with the symbol of a Hellknight order and often notched with the number of times it has absorbed damage.</p><p><strong>Activate—Terrifying Block:</strong> @Glyph[Free] (concentrate, emotion, fear, mental)</p><p><strong>Частота:</strong> Раз в 10 минут</p><p><strong>Триггер:</strong> You Shield Block</p><hr /><p><strong>Эффект:</strong> When a weapon strikes an imposing shield, the sigil glows with a chilling light. The creature that made the attack that triggered your Shield Block becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}. If the Shield Block reduced the incoming damage to 0, the creature instead becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}.</p><table class=\"pf2e remaster\"><thead><tr><th>Твёрдость</th><th>ОЗ</th><th>ПП</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>6</td><td>36</td><td>18</td></tr></tbody></table>"
