            "description": "<p><strong>Активация:</strong> @Glyph[Action 1] <strong>Strike</strong></p><p>Atrophy bombs contain powerful chemicals developed by Urgathoan alchemists that sap a living creature's strength and drain their energy. The bomb deals 3d4 persistent void damage and 3 void splash damage, and the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} until the start of your next turn. You gain a +2 item bonus to attack rolls with this bomb.</p>"
