            "description": "<p><strong>Активация:</strong> @Glyph[Action 1] <strong>(manipulate)</strong></p><hr /><p>An Isgeri specialty from Etran's Folly, this root vegetable porridge was named after the dwarf trader Bort Bargith. When you eat this porridge, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.JuqmIAnkL9hVGai8] for an additional 10 minutes during exploration. This lasts for 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first.</p>"
