            "type": "equipment",
            "nameRus": "Whispering Wire (Greater)",
            "description": "<p>This coiled cord of brightly colored wire can be twisted neatly into any shape.</p><p><strong>Activate—Words on the Wind:</strong> @Glyph[Action 1] (@Trait[Concentrate]{концентрация})</p><p><strong>Частота:</strong> Раз в 10 минут</p><hr /><p><strong>Эффект:</strong> You quietly mouth words to the wire, which sends them to a target with the effects of the 3rd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.vLzFcIaSXs7YTIqJ] cantrip.</p>"
