            "description": "<p><strong>Аспекты:</strong> вода</p><hr /><p>Little is known about the origins of this wintry cloak of snowflakes, which functions as a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.hvlEFx25ogf1K1C2] but with snow instead of plants.</p><hr /><p><strong>Малые дары:</strong> : monsoon curtain, tidal crash</p><p><strong>Большие дары:</strong> : bottomless reservoir, flowing footsteps</p><p><strong>Grand Gift:</strong> : ripples and waves</p>"
